# Build-time env for the E2E bundle (`npm run build:e2e`, mode `e2e`).
#
# The API base is the app's own origin, where e2e/server.mjs answers every
# REST route as a test double and mirrors the WebSocket gateway. The suite
# therefore never talks to a real backend (local or deployed), which keeps it
# hermetic, parallel-safe and reproducible in CI.
#
# VITE_USE_MOCKS must stay false. config.ts defaults it to true when unset,
# which would silently swap in the in-memory demo fixtures and the E2E run
# would be exercising mock data, not the app's real API client.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4173
VITE_USE_MOCKS=false